error[B0223]: this call can throw, and it is not marked with `try`
 --> check/surface_models.bloom:6:43
  |
6 | func unmarked() throws(APIError) -> Int { load() }
  |                                           ^^^^^^ a throwing call
  |
help: write `try` before it (`try?` for `none` on an error, `do { try … } catch { … }` to handle it)
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#6-expressions-and-control-flow

error[B0224]: errors thrown from here are not handled
 --> check/surface_models.bloom:8:27
  |
8 | func unhandled() -> Int { try load() }
  |                           ^^^^^^^^^^ this function does not throw
  |
help: mark the function `throws`, catch it in `do { … } catch { … }`, or write `try?`
